   "text": "PK id\n   code        ctis, manual, ... (unique)\n   kind        registry | publications | manual\n   name, url\n   adapter     the code that reads it (unique)\n   enabled     switched on or off\n   config      jsonb: what to list, what to\n               transfer (checked by the adapter)\n   created_at, created_by → actor",
