   "text": "PK source_id, source_key  FK → trial_source\n   status          complete | failed (and failed\n                   while a transfer runs)\n   transferred_at, transferred_by → actor\nFK ingest_run_id → ingest_run   (kind transfer)\n   document_kinds  kinds it brought (NULL: all)\n   source_updated_on   as listed when transferred\n   documents, pages, errors jsonb",
   "originalText": "PK source_id, source_key  FK → trial_source\n   status          complete | failed (and failed\n                   while a transfer runs)\n   transferred_at, transferred_by → actor\nFK ingest_run_id → ingest_run   (kind transfer)\n   document_kinds  kinds it brought (NULL: all)\n   source_updated_on   as listed when transferred\n   documents, pages, errors jsonb",
