   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PK id\n   check_name     evidence\nFK actor_id → core.actor   who ran it\n   model, effort  what answered, how hard\n   prompt, prompt_sha256, prompt_text\n                  the prompt file, as sent\n   requirements, _sha256, _text   as read\n   params         jsonb: method, top_k, ...\n   status         running | succeeded |\n                  failed | stopped\n   error          why it ended early\n   started_at, finished_at\n   trials, errors, input/output_tokens\na run whose process died is closed as failed\nby the next run (advisory lock while alive)",
   "originalText": "PK id\n   check_name     evidence\nFK actor_id → core.actor   who ran it\n   model, effort  what answered, how hard\n   prompt, prompt_sha256, prompt_text\n                  the prompt file, as sent\n   requirements, _sha256, _text   as read\n   params         jsonb: method, top_k, ...\n   status         running | succeeded |\n                  failed | stopped\n   error          why it ended early\n   started_at, finished_at\n   trials, errors, input/output_tokens\na run whose process died is closed as failed\nby the next run (advisory lock while alive)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
