   "text": "PK run_id, trial_id  (trial → core.trial)\n   label       full | not full | undecided\n               (NULL only with an error)\n   parts       jsonb by name; NULL = undecided,\n               a person decides, never a guess\n   trace       jsonb: rule + evidence id each\n   trial_record_id, document_versions\n               the inputs read\n   served_by   text[]: model per call\n   tokens, duration_ms, error",
