   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PK id\n   at\nFK actor_id → core.actor   who it was for\n   provider, model   the model that ran it\n   operation   check, annotate\nFK check_run_id → checks.run, trial_id → core.trial\n   call_number   1 first call, 2 widening\nFK annotation_run_id → search.annotation_run\nFK job_id → jobs.job   (trialwatch.job default)\n   input_, output_, cache_write_, cache_read_tokens\n   cost_usd    NULL: model not in prices.json\n   prices      jsonb: the prices it was charged at\n   request_id  the provider's",
   "originalText": "PK id\n   at\nFK actor_id → core.actor   who it was for\n   provider, model   the model that ran it\n   operation   check, annotate\nFK check_run_id → checks.run, trial_id → core.trial\n   call_number   1 first call, 2 widening\nFK annotation_run_id → search.annotation_run\nFK job_id → jobs.job   (trialwatch.job default)\n   input_, output_, cache_write_, cache_read_tokens\n   cost_usd    NULL: model not in prices.json\n   prices      jsonb: the prices it was charged at\n   request_id  the provider's",
