   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1763726400000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Also: checks.run and core.ingest_run have job_id → jobs.job (default: the session's trialwatch.job);\nchecks.run and checks.judgement have cost_usd and cache_write_tokens, cache_read_tokens.\ncore.actor 1 is the process trialwatch: migrations, scheduled jobs, automatic checks and publishing.",
   "originalText": "Also: checks.run and core.ingest_run have job_id → jobs.job (default: the session's trialwatch.job);\nchecks.run and checks.judgement have cost_usd and cache_write_tokens, cache_read_tokens.\ncore.actor 1 is the process trialwatch: migrations, scheduled jobs, automatic checks and publishing.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
