   "text": "PK trial_id   FK → core.trial\n   profile_hash   the profile it was built from\n   recruiting, recruiting_countries\n   title, conditions, categories, phase\n   age_groups, age_min, age_max (AI, quoted)\n   female, male, healthy_volunteers, patients\n   interventions, purposes   (AI, quoted)\nFK annotation_id → search.annotation\n   tsv   tsvector, weights A-D (GIN index):\n         A conditions, B titles, C products,\n         D inclusion; exclusion never",
   "originalText": "PK trial_id   FK → core.trial\n   profile_hash   the profile it was built from\n   recruiting, recruiting_countries\n   title, conditions, categories, phase\n   age_groups, age_min, age_max (AI, quoted)\n   female, male, healthy_volunteers, patients\n   interventions, purposes   (AI, quoted)\nFK annotation_id → search.annotation\n   tsv   tsvector, weights A-D (GIN index):\n         A conditions, B titles, C products,\n         D inclusion; exclusion never",
