   "text": "PK id   UNIQUE run_id, trial_id\nFK run_id → annotation_run, trial_id → trial\n   profile_hash   the profile it read\n   facts     jsonb: kept tags, each with field\n             and a quote found in it\n   dropped   jsonb: tags dropped, and why\n   request, raw_answer, error, served_by\n   tokens, cost_usd, duration_ms",
   "originalText": "PK id   UNIQUE run_id, trial_id\nFK run_id → annotation_run, trial_id → trial\n   profile_hash   the profile it read\n   facts     jsonb: kept tags, each with field\n             and a quote found in it\n   dropped   jsonb: tags dropped, and why\n   request, raw_answer, error, served_by\n   tokens, cost_usd, duration_ms",
